read error: #flint/table is a flint-only reader tag, and test/reader/err-portable-tag.cljc is a PORTABLE file. Nothing outside flint can read it: a tag is bound by flint's workspace (:flint/tag-readers) or by flint's reader itself, and another platform's reader knows neither (DECISIONS.md#dialects-and-preludes). Rename the file to .fln -- a .fln and a .cljc are the same namespace, and flint prefers its own -- or write the value without the tag. (test/reader/err-portable-tag.cljc:1:24)